<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Weapons List</h1>
<p>The weapons of the world, each with a help page of its own: what it 
looked like, how it was used, and how it is fought in Valhalla. Those in 
the first list are weapon skills of their own, which you can practice 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>); the others are fought with the skill of the kind of 
weapon each one is.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Weapon_skills">Weapon skills</span></h2>
<p><b>Axes and hammers:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Battle Axe</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Hand Axe</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Mattock</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Maul</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help War Hammer</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Adze</a>
</p><p><b>Swords:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Great Sword</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Claymore</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Long Sword</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Broad Sword</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Falchion</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Scimitar</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Short Sword</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Rapier</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Main Gauche</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Stiletto</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Dagger</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Sickle</a>
</p><p><b>Clubs and maces:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Club</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Mace</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Morning Star</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Flail</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Ball and Chain</a>
</p><p><b>Polearms:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Quarterstaff</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Spear</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Javelin</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Lance</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Trident</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Halberd</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Bardiche</a>
</p><p><b>Special:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Whip</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Long Bow</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Crossbow</a>
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Other_weapons">Other weapons</span></h2>
<p><b>Swords and knives:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Bastard Sword</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Curved Sword</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cutlass</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Dirk</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Estoc</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Fish Spine</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Flamberge</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Kopesh</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Sappara</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Shamshir</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Talwar</a>
</p><p><b>Clubs, hammers and axes:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Baculus</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Cudgel</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Crowbill</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Bec de Corbin</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Hammer of Kai</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Lucern</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help War Axe</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Gaff</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Staff</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Fighting Staff</a>
</p><p><b>Pole arms:</b> <a cmd='#'>Help Pole Arms</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Pole Axe</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Pole Cleaver</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Spear Family</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Pike</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Foot Lance</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Pilum</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Partisan</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Ranseur</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Spetum</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Glaive</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Naginata</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Guisarme</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Bill Guisarme</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Bill Hook</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Voulge</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Lochaber</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Jeddart</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Fauchard</a>, 
<a cmd='#'>Help Fauchard Fork</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Military Fork</a>, <a cmd='#'>Help Odd Weapon</a>
</p><p><br />
